@abstract:
Trust and provenance verification for Dafniser.
Maximal trust by default — LLM may read, build, test, lint, format.
@end

@trust-level: maximal
@trust-boundary: repo
@trust-actions: [read, build, test, lint, format]
@trust-deny: [delete-branch, force-push, modify-ci-secrets, publish]

## Integrity

### license-content
- description: LICENSE contains expected SPDX identifier
- run: grep -q 'SPDX\|MPL-2.0' LICENSE
- severity: critical

### no-secrets-committed
- description: No .env or credential files tracked by Git
- run: test -z "$(git ls-files -- .env '.env.*' credentials.json)"
- severity: critical
